es out of bounds for indices ≥ 10.\n- `main_matches`: 5 two-line stdin variants exercising the full `main()` flow.\n\nAll 5 tests pass under both the default and `--no-default-features` configurations (run with `--test-threads=1` because the tests redirect global stdin/stdout file descriptors)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":507,"cache_read_input_tokens":36698,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":507,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"4c9fb403-8f49-4268-aa35-8ecbae108636","uuid":"e3b703c3-95ef-44e3-9097-71646ee2c902"}
